fieldValues.revisit_when:
Revisit if:
- the owner, reviewing in the card, corrects more than a few of the agents' pole-to-pole orientations, which would mean the inherited reading is not reliable;
- a pole is found standing as a default that the owner would have rejected;
- or the default-axes ruling (06d83ca7) is itself revised.

The indicator is records in Affirmed whose createdBy is an AI actor, which should be 0.
